{"parse": {"title": "Elder aquanite", "pageid": 608471, "revid": 15357568, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs=Aquanite (elite)}}\n{{Infobox Monster\n|version1 = Lure\n|version2 = No lure\n|name = Elder aquanite\n|image1 = [[File:Elder aquanite (lure).png|250x250px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Elder aquanite (no lure).png|250x250px]]\n|release = [[19 November]] [[2025]]\n|update = Sailing is OUT TODAY!\n|members = Yes\n|combat = 305\n|size = 3\n|examine1 = Such an alluring light...\n|examine2 = It's lost its light. Poor thing.\n|attributes = <!-- if no monster attributes apply, remove this parameter -->\n|xpbonus = 5\n|max hit = 34 (normal), 50 (special attack)\n|aggressive = No\n|poisonous = No\n|attack style = Magic\n|attack speed = 5\n|slaylvl = 78\n|slayxp = 4200\n|cat = Aquanite\n|assignedby = nieve,duradel, Mortimer\n|hitpoints = 400\n|att = 1\n|str = 1\n|def = 180\n|mage = 330\n|range = 1\n|attbns = 0\n|strbns = 0\n|amagic = 0\n|mbns1 = 50\n|mbns2 = 10\n|arange = 0\n|rngbns = 0\n|dstab1 = 60\n|dstab2 = 10\n|dslash = 80\n|dcrush = 80\n|dmagic = 140\n|dlight = 100\n|dstandard = 100\n|dheavy = 100\n|elementalweaknesstype = <!-- if no weakness, remove this parameter -->\n|elementalweaknesspercent = <!-- if no weakness, remove this parameter -->\n|poisonresistance = 100\n|venomresistance = 0\n|immunecannon = yes\n|id1 = 15502\n|id2 = 15503\n|leagueRegion = No\n}}\n'''Elder aquanites''' are the [[Superior slayer monster|superior]] variant of [[aquanite]]s. It has a chance of spawning after purchasing the unlock ''Bigger and Badder'' for 50 [[Slayer reward point]]s from any [[Slayer master]].\n\nElder aquanites have a special attack that disables protection prayers, which can occur when having [[Protect from Magic]] active for an extended period; as such, briefly disabling it after every attack will help avoid it. If the special attack occurs, it deals a guaranteed hit dealing up to 50 damage, alongside a game message stating {{mes|The aquanite disables your protection prayers!|color=#ff3045}}\n\nLike normal aquanites, hitting it once with [[slash]] attack style reduces its stab defence.\n\n==Drops==\n''In addition to 100% drops and tertiary drops, superior slayer monsters will always roll 3 additional items, of which only 1 roll may be from the superior unique table. The other rolls are performed on the regular counterpart's table; their displayed drop chances represent a single roll.''\n\n{{DropLogProject|kills=445086}}\n\n===100%===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Big bones|quantity=1|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Sailing resources===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Aquanite tendon|quantity=1|rarity=1/750|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Dragon cannonball|quantity=9-15|rarity=1/128|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Rune cannonball|quantity=14-22|rarity=1/64|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Umbral frag|quantity=1|rarity=1/22|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Pillar frag|quantity=1-3|rarity=1/22|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Elkhorn frag|quantity=2-4|rarity=1/22|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Seeds===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Snape grass seed|quantity=1-3|rarity=1/22|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Ranarr seed|quantity=1|rarity=1/16|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Irit seed|quantity=1|rarity=1/16|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Avantoe seed|quantity=1|rarity=1/16|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Kwuarm seed|quantity=1|rarity=1/16|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Cadantine seed|quantity=1|rarity=1/16|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Watermelon seed|quantity=3-5|rarity=1/22|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Pineapple seed|quantity=1|rarity=1/22|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Snape grass|quantity=1-2|rarity=1/13|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Seaweed|quantity=1|rarity=1/13|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Shark lure|quantity=3-5|rarity=1/22|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Uncut diamond|quantity=1|rarity=1/42|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Water rune|quantity=150-350|rarity=1/13|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Water battlestaff|quantity=1|rarity=1/22|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=104-188|rarity=1/32|approx=yes|rolls=3}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineClue|type=hard|rarity=Unknown|raritynotes=}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Long bone|quantity=1|rarity=1/400}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Curved bone|quantity=1|rarity=1/5012.5}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Superior Slayer tertiary===\n{{SuperiorDropTable|78}}\n\n==Collection log==\nElder aquanites have 6 [[collection log]] items.\n{{Sync}}\n{{Collection log list|cname1=Mist battlestaff|cname2=Dust battlestaff|cname3=Eternal gem|cname4=Imbued heart|cname5=Aquanite tendon|cname6=Dragon cannonball}}\n\n{{Slayer monsters}}\n[[Category:Slayer monsters that can only be fought on task]]\n[[Category:Monsters that take priority in combat]]"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:05.537112+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Big_bones\" title=\"Big bones\"><img alt=\"Big bones.png: Elder aquanite drops Big bones with rarity Always in quantity 1\" src=\"/images/Big_bones.png?3be33\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-wid